{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17mini_level_act17mini_st04","groupId":"act17mini","stageId":null,"title":"未完成的态度","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17mini/level_act17mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"d463e4c2fa81433101223d5e08c9a63032c1fe462660cce74e35a861bf1e5cae","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，埃米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"已经过了两天了，有什么新进展吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到好几个了！嗯，其实也就两个......不过你放心，应该很快就能结束！怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"没事，也就是老家伙突然想起来关心这件事，过来催我几句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"本来以为这些碎片会把卡兹戴尔搞得天翻地覆的，现在看来还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"没人因为这件事去敲军事委员会的门，我们也没检测出来什么异常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）因为事情都被我碰上了啊，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"总之，你按照自己的节奏来就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯，就这样，记得安全第一，遇上搞不定的事记得来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好嘞，谢谢埃米~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米做事还是这么周到，我也得抓紧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想好吃什么没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？哦，对不起，我这就挑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就尝尝这个吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么新食物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是烤面团啊，你又不是第一次在我这儿吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，是不是变好吃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比以前有嚼劲了，还有点......甜味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？可能是进的料比以前好了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近回来的人越来越多，有渠道买点便宜的好料，面团也就更香了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，以后还需要我去帮忙砍价吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，之前一个来我这里吃东西的雇佣兵，帮我联络了一家更好的供应商，他们价格挺合适的，也好交流，就不麻烦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可太好了！再这样下去您这里是不是可以做维多利亚那儿的白面包了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你个贪吃鬼，白面包有什么好吃的，下次找个机会，过来吃烤兽肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？！烤兽肉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能再给我三个烤面团吗？我想带走路上吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，稍等会，我给你拿刚出炉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，谢谢您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼~这两天忙了这么多事，也该犒劳一下自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......没有什么比美美地填饱肚子更幸福的事了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙一眼就瞥见了那个萨卡兹。当然，她并不是故意的。\n无论是谁，只要路过这里，都会被那道身影吸引。\n拄着手杖，戴着礼帽，昂着头颅，一动不动地站在那里。\n在一个大部分人都蓬头垢面、衣冠不整的地方，这样的人实在是太稀奇了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，你要的面团。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好，谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次见她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前好像没见过这样的......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不是一开始就这样的，不知道什么时候发了疯，离开卡兹戴尔出去闯荡了一阵，回来以后就变这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......话是这么说，但是，很好看呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好看有什么用，往那一站就是一天，啥都卖不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也卖烤面团吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是。她会用那些废料做首饰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有些奇怪的玩意，像是透明玻璃巫术球，里面放个卡兹戴尔的模型，还有印着奇怪图案的杯子——全都又贵又容易碎，傻子才买。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说还有什么摆件和雕塑，那些就更属于没人买的玩意了。平常用不上，卖得还那么贵，也不知道她是怎么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周边那些和她关系稍微好点儿的都劝过她，但她就是听不进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天能看到一个穿得漂漂亮亮的人在街上，总归也不是件坏事嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是希望她能赚点粮食养活自己......要是饿死在我这烤面团的摊位前面，那岂不是闹笑话了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，您说的也有些道理......我该走了，回头见~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街边摊贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见小妮芙，下次多介绍点朋友来光顾我这小摊啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘不了的，拜拜~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......吃饱喝足，该继续干活了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真好看啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是维多利亚的款式吗？用料一看就很贵。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有那枚镶着紫红色宝石的胸针......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等忙完埃米的事情，拿到报酬，就去她的摊位上逛逛吧！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？在这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，刚刚还没有的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到底在哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镶着紫红色宝石的胸针......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙猛地反应过来，看向那个无人光顾的小摊。\n可那里已经没人了，戴着礼帽的摊主早已收拾好货物，消失在了卡兹戴尔的人流中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米，你快接啊，有急事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这可怎么办啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真的是因为被附身了才做成首饰随身带着，那位女士她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了，我得先跟上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，您知道，刚刚在这里摆摊的女士去哪了吗？就是穿着礼服、戴着礼帽的那位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什么是礼服？嗯......就是穿得很奇怪、东西没人买的那位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是往这个方向去了吗？好的，谢......烤面团？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是在街角那一头的小摊上买的，我送你一个吧，要是觉得好吃可以去那里买！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里都快到城市出口了，她来这里做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探测装置......反应很微弱，但应该就在这里没错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得仔细找找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仓库？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是住在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，哪有穿那么华贵却住在这种地方的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说......是那枚死魂灵碎片？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米联系不上，珀耳去其他地方找碎片了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快动动你的脑子，妮芙，一定有办法的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"催眠、心理暗示、源石技艺......哪怕硬抢呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，女士，找我有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，请让我再想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说了算，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克伦妮·“雅仕”·曼提尔，很荣幸见到你，有什么能为你效劳的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您能把胸针卖给我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为，因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我很喜欢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，女士，它是非卖品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，它和你的衣服并不相称。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这里有更好的点缀，能与玫瑰相符的绝配，如果你需要的话，我可以将那枚给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我只想要这枚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙紧盯着对方的眼睛，垂在身侧的手指以特殊的频率轻轻晃动着，在空气中画出一个个复杂的图形。\n这些图案倒映在克伦妮的眼瞳中，却在眨眼时被轻轻拭去，没能如预料那般深入心灵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我恐怕不能如你所愿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在找到更好的替代品前，我不会放弃这枚宝石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些要紧事，就不招待了。请回吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻轻挥动法杖）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声吟唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您稍等片刻，听听我的愿望吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙的法术从她的意志中飞掠而出，轻柔地落在了克伦妮身上。\n一秒，两秒......\n目标越走越远。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没效果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂灵碎片就被她戴在身上，想要绕开死魂灵去触碰她的内心，的确不是一件容易的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要用那个蠢办法吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，笞心魔小姐，我赶时间，请别挡路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米，赶紧回个话吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技艺用不上，打也打不过，抢也抢不动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是个小贩吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先跟着吧，妮芙，就当看看先祖想要带着她去哪里了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算出事了，也好第一时间把具体情况告诉埃米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她总不会一路跑到城外去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经是城区边缘了，她到底要去哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道真的要出城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我应该可以和在城门值班的巫妖们联系一下，埃米给过我联系方式，他们一定可以截住碎片的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_L1"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙看到，克伦妮打开手提箱，从里面取出了一架简易滑翔翼。\n克伦妮一手用手杖钩住滑翔翼骨架，一手抓住手提箱把手，以她特有的笔挺身姿挂在滑翔翼下方，逐渐远离了卡兹戴尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂灵碎片连这样的事都能做到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还是先......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，埃米那个家伙靠不住的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，要不还是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着渐渐飘远的滑翔翼，妮芙踌躇了好久，但最终，还是下定了决心。\n她将钥索末端插入法杖上的锁孔，钥索崩断，化作了绕身的钥匙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙取出一把钥匙，打开腰间的包，钥匙顿时分成两群。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一群接在法杖上，如旋翼般快速转动。\n一群被妮芙踩在脚下，减轻重力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_L1"},{"type":"narration","text":"滞留在空中是一种很奇妙的体验。\n顺着风飘向远方，看着熟悉的事物渐渐变小、变小。\n直到看清卡兹戴尔的整个轮廓，看着城市的棱角在暖阳中变得模糊。\n然后，迎着微风与暖意——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"在分心的瞬间向下坠去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用我的手帕擦擦汗吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......谢......谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从来没见过你这么莽撞的人。那些源石技艺，你自己都没有用熟练，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确......确实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是您刚刚飞过来拉了我一把，我真要直接摔地上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的手帕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您每次离开城市都是这样下来的吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快捷、便利、优雅，多么美妙的方法，灵感来自谢拉格的雪山缆车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您去过谢拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终有一天我会去的，不过现在，看看报纸上的图画就已足够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去吧，小笞心魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是个奇怪的先祖......他就这么着急离开卡兹戴尔吗？还非得带上克伦妮一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，已经完全没有信号了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自求多福吧，妮芙。你的大冒险要开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，终于停下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看样子不是要直接离开卡兹戴尔。"},{"type":"narration","text":"远远地，妮芙看到克伦妮深深吸了一口气，然后大声念出了一句奇怪的......咒语？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>“出来吧，苦难陈述者！”</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“苦难陈述者”？那是什么，咒语吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能是魔王名讳吧，古老的魔王有这种名讳好像也没什么问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如您所愿，老朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，好久不见啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨、萨科塔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是他的计划吗，还有萨科塔接应？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他究竟要干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你了，小笞心魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有必要躲在石头后面，出来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的小学徒这么见外吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女士不是我的学徒，可能是有些误会吧，她一直在跟着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你继续戴着这枚胸针到处乱逛的话，我猜你很快就会被通缉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你的建议，莫斯提马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先让我看一下我订的货物，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫斯提马轻轻一抬，把箱子送到了两人面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你订购的货物——三匹大炎特等柔光绸，送到了，验一下货吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......这就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这抗拒触摸的柔滑，这显现诸色的洁白......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来他真的要离开卡兹戴尔啊，连物资都准备好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那个萨科塔怎么不见了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好啊，小笞心魔，今天天气不错呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别过来，我、我是术师，我源石技艺很强的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可太巧了，你看，我也是术师，我们还算是半个同行不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你是......我是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，你也是讲道理的人，不会无缘无故攻击我这个手无寸铁的信使吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就当默认了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克伦妮验货还需要些时间，我就在这里吹吹风，偷会懒，不会打扰到你的。怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你是个信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"企鹅物流，使命必达~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要吃颗拉特兰的糖果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......那这个给你，喏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔的烤面团，可惜已经冷了......热的时候更好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不客气了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和克伦妮......是怎么认识的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是客户隐私，而且你确定要听一个萨科塔讲故事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定我会在谎言里编织一个陷阱把你的灵魂骗进去哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请说吧，我能判断真假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然大家都把萨科塔说得很可怕，可......毕竟你没用铳对着我扫射，也没有把我的角掰下来挂在腰间当战利品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好。那就让我自言自语几句吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......从哪里说起好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前，在乌萨斯送货的时候，我遇上了一个萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说是在家里待不下去了，出来闯荡，刚刚找到了自己想走的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯对许多东西的管控都很严格，所以那个萨卡兹就经常委托我们帮她送些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克伦妮小姐在乌萨斯做设计师吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"设计师？呵呵，乌萨斯人愿意让一个萨卡兹做助理就算是大发善心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实那是个由萨卡兹创建的品牌，但在乌萨斯太过流行了，经常被当作乌萨斯的本土企业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，你眼前那个把布料当性命的人最早也是这么认为的，她就这样在乌萨斯碰了一鼻子灰，最终兜兜转转回到了你们这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她应该是赚够钱才回来的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱？呵呵，她恐怕和有钱没什么关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从某种程度上来说，你见到的，就是她的全部了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，货没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么她还要买布料呢？我到过她住的地方，也见过她周围的人，她为了买这些名贵的布料，似乎连饭都吃不饱了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道她提前预见了大熔炉会爆炸，想让死魂灵附着在那些布料上？不行，完全说不通啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我好像听到了点不得了的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道你在说些什么，但我们该过去了，来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么要吩咐的吗，克伦妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢，莫斯提马，一路过来辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里的话，我也只是收钱办事罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后续的话，我还想要些萨尔贡的布料，还是像以前那样先付全款给你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以是可以，不过抱歉，以后你大概不需要我来送这些东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了，你的公司变更运营策略了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，不要误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后这些东西在卡兹戴尔就可以买，没有必要找企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近来你们卡兹戴尔的商队数量翻了好几番，罗德岛的家伙们也给萨卡兹搭了好几次线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过不了多久，你们那儿大概就会有固定售卖进口货物的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说......我的卡兹戴尔纪念品也可以卖出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水晶球、杯子之类的旅游纪念品......和你在别的国家见到的没什么两样，不过出自卡兹戴尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，谁会想来卡兹戴尔旅游呢？这里似乎也没什么好观光的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我还挺想进卡兹戴尔逛逛的，看看你们的魂灵熔炉，你们的街道，还有那个“知识圣殿”......是有这个地方的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可惜我没这个机会。你的点子听着有点意思，到时候和那帮商人聊聊吧，或许他们真愿意买些“旅游纪念品”拿回去炫耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记下了，谢谢。还有你，这位笞心魔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我妮芙就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，妮芙女士，我们该回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。那......再见，萨科塔信使小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，下次有什么需要记得联系企鹅物流哦，联系方式找克伦妮要就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......你是不是也该露面了，“苦难陈述者”，还是“烈火爆炸狂”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你疯了吗，为了送货跑到卡兹戴尔来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被萨卡兹抓住，你根本没机会活着离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老主顾的单，不接不太好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道在担心我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......监管你是我的工作，现在跟我回去，立刻，马上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，这荒郊野外的我能逃到哪去呢，要不，去卡兹戴尔玩一天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（举起武器）......走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真难劝啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到寒舍。"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙和克伦妮逛了一天，最终回到了她们初次交谈的仓库。\n妮芙本以为这是死魂灵操控着克伦妮躲开人群的藏身之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的是住人的地方啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一张床，一个小工作台，几件挂着的衣服，一个放杂物的角落。基本的家具都没有几件......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从某种程度上来说，你见到的，就是她的全部了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请随意些，把这里当作自己的家就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要帮忙吗，克伦妮小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我自己来就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您买的这种布料，很贵吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概几个月的伙食？这不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这里不应该用胸针，用布料做一根饰带来搭衬的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妮芙女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要这枚胸针，是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，那不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去吧，我不需要它了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉重的凝滞感从胸针上传来，让妮芙不禁打了个寒战。她赶紧把那枚被当成宝石的碎片丢进手提箱中。\n从始至终，这枚死魂灵碎片除了附在胸针上之外，好像什么都没有做。\n没有控制什么奇怪的造物，也没有在人群中引起争端。\n当他落在手心里时，自己甚至还感受到了一些气愤和无奈，就像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对驮兽弹琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没事，只是脑子里冒出来些奇怪的想法......您好些了吗，克伦妮小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的关心，我一直很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（语气好像和之前没什么区别，真的恢复了吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么需要我帮忙的，尽管和我说就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......妮芙女士......其实我有个不情之请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是叫我妮芙吧，不用那么客气啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，妮芙，能过来一下吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙看清了克伦妮工作台上的衣服，那似乎是件礼服，但却并不是克伦妮的尺寸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"试试看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"克伦妮掏出皮尺，快速地在妮芙身上比划了几下，嘴里念叨了几个不同的数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应当是合身的，试穿一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件衣服是不是很贵重？我怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，它还没做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我就试着穿穿看了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尺寸合适吗，袖口紧不紧，有没有哪里觉得别扭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有，很合适......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这件衣服，是为您的某位朋友做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这是送给我自己的礼物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"制作它是我的心愿，很可惜，我还没能完成它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得它已经很完美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还差得远呢。袖口还要修，装饰还得调，它还很粗糙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以脱下来了，妮芙，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喔，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您为什么要做一件自己不能穿的衣服呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为它的出现给我的人生指了一个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想过与众不同的生活，但我又热爱这座城市。所以我试过许多方法来博取人们的注意，都是些萨卡兹的老套路，你应该很了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最终的结果就是，我被赶出了卡兹戴尔，在荒野上流浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人为我提供了一份在乌萨斯的卑微的工作，原本我只是抱着能活下去就好的心态去试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但后来，我发现自己很适合那些灵巧的活计，更重要的是，我得到了一份设计师的手稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个卡兹戴尔的萨卡兹设计师，卡兹戴尔的，设计师，我从没想到这些词能够放在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那份手稿上记录的，就是这件衣服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。手稿损毁得很厉害，许多信息都丢失了，除了写了一半的“为了AM”和这件礼服的框架，其他的什么都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我总觉得，里面包含着一份我从没感受过的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了了解它，我学了制衣，还做了许多其他的小玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧，从前的卡兹戴尔忘记了我，所以我回来了，用一个新身份回到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我一样，卡兹戴尔也变了不少，它变得宽容了。连我这样的异类，也能拥有一方舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您才会做那些卖不出去的东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是旅游纪念品，总有一天，卡兹戴尔也会接待来自全泰拉的游客——我是这样相信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然只是由着自己的性子试个水，但别的地方有的，卡兹戴尔也能有，而且不一定就比他们的差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是一件时尚的衣服，还是一套旅游纪念品，甚至是......一种生活的方式，对美的追求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想得也太远啦......卡兹戴尔变成旅游景点这种事，我在梦里也见不到呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过最近城里确实变了不少，来来往往，热闹了很多，和以前都不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看前几天夜里的烟花，多漂亮啊，说不定大熔炉也是因为太热闹、太高兴，才炸出这么好看的烟花。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"怎么了，妮芙？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着你啦，本来收集碎片的时候出了些岔子，现在已经搞定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那就好。今天我在帮老头......咳，协助老师进行一些命结方面的研究，意识不在这里，不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，城里差不多都排查过一遍了，就剩一片新修的生活区还没去。说不定明天我就搞定了，先帮我准备报酬吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"弄好了直接来拿就好，少不了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"早点休息吧，再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，再见埃米。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也不打扰您了，克伦妮小姐，有什么事的话记得来找我，这是我的联系方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克伦妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢。晚安，妮芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini02_katzdalesquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......好累......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上买的烤面团，结果自己都没吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......回家热一热的话，一定会更好吃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀耳，你怎么找到我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天走了城门，又从城墙上飞下去，这么显眼，那些情报贩子都聊了半天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么发现吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，军事委员会的驻扎区附近和聚居地都没有碎片的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这边，应该是有所收获，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你看！今天我找到的这个碎片很好看的，像宝石一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是大熔炉里头烧出来的玻璃块吧，颜色的确很独特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，把这块碎片交给我的人，也很独特呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过今天实在太困了，跑了一天，又累又饿，哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去休息吧，反正我们要排查的地方就只剩下最后一片生活区了，争取明天搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧你困得都要撞墙了......唉，还是我送送你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别睡着呀，路上你刚好给我讲讲那个“独特的人”是怎么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......今天，我去集市上买了一个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个烤面团，好香好香......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
